          "prompt": "Match the words to the right pictures.",
          "hint": "Tim says: One part helps you step, and another bends."
        },
        "ex-3": {
          "prompt": "Build the word from the letters.",
          "hint": "Tim says: It is the front of your head, where your eyes, nose, and mouth are."
        },
        "ex-4": {
